{
  "description": "Page 04 canned chat (concept 04, Results). Seeded through app_seed_thread in this order on the seeded research vehicle (fixtures/research-vehicle/seed.sh); the last thread is the one the capture opens. Every page shows the concept's three threads (Assembly review 3m, Fin revision 1h, Flight comparison 2h; the rail sorts by recency), each bound to the page. Flight comparison mentions two runs, so its turn lists the runs (rw_run_list), shows the Flight runs step card (rw_history_show; Compare: rw:step/4, 04.agent.show-differences; B14) and compares the two runs (rw_run_diff) on the run card: both altitude traces in the page's series colours, Baseline teal and Higher altitude sand (POL; Open: rw:run/<id> of Higher altitude, 04.agent.open-details); no edit or new run (CPW1R4A). The cards keep the list and compare rows apart in the imported turn, and the one-line reply lets the turn fit the embedded pane. Illustrative chat text, not engineering output.",
  "threads": [
    {
      "thread": "Assembly review",
      "binding": {
        "page": "results"
      },
      "ageMs": 220000,
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "text": "Show how the recovery bay fits.",
          "mentions": [
            {
              "ref": "rw:c/recovery_bay",
              "label": "Recovery bay"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "Exploded view ready. The recovery bay is selected in the model.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "tool": "viewport_select",
              "input": {
                "refs": [
                  "rw:c/recovery_bay"
                ]
              },
              "output": {
                "selected": [
                  "rw:c/recovery_bay"
                ]
              },
              "summary": "1 selected"
            },
            {
              "tool": "viewport_set_camera",
              "input": {
                "view": "iso",
                "explode": 0.6
              },
              "output": {},
              "summary": "Iso view · exploded 60%"
            },
            {
              "tool": "viewport_render",
              "input": {
                "view": "iso"
              },
              "output": {
                "width": 1536,
                "height": 1024,
                "backend": "webgpu",
                "adapter": "capture"
              },
              "summary": "Iso view"
            }
          ],
          "cards": [
            {
              "kind": "step",
              "ref": "rw:step/2",
              "title": "Assembly layout",
              "summary": "3 fields changed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "thread": "Fin revision",
      "binding": {
        "page": "results"
      },
      "ageMs": 4200000,
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "text": "Can the fins get a little more span? [@Fin can](rw:c/fin_can)",
          "mentions": [
            {
              "ref": "rw:c/fin_can",
              "label": "Fin can"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "The fin span is a parameter, so one edit changes all four fins. Span is now 100 mm and sweep 40 mm; run Check model to see the new stability margin.",
          "cards": [
            {
              "kind": "step",
              "ref": "rw:step/3",
              "title": "Fin revision",
              "summary": "2 fields changed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "thread": "Flight comparison",
      "binding": {
        "page": "results"
      },
      "ageMs": 8100000,
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "text": "What changed between these flights?",
          "mentions": [
            {
              "ref": "rw:sim/baseline",
              "label": "Baseline"
            },
            {
              "ref": "rw:sim/higher_altitude",
              "label": "Higher altitude"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "Higher altitude climbs higher in the same wind.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "tool": "run_list",
              "input": {},
              "output": {},
              "summary": "4 runs"
            },
            {
              "tool": "history_show",
              "input": {
                "version": "step:4"
              },
              "card": {
                "kind": "step",
                "ref": "rw:step/4",
                "title": "Flight runs"
              },
              "summary": "Step 4 · Flight runs"
            },
            {
              "tool": "run_diff",
              "input": {
                "a": "baseline",
                "b": "higher_altitude"
              },
              "card": {
                "kind": "run",
                "ref": "rw:sim/higher_altitude",
                "title": "Higher altitude"
              },
              "summary": "2 runs · apogee +200%"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
